{"version":1,"key":"article:50","content":{"id":50,"title":"防抖与节流","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64dd2e57-5a07-4b41-89cf-d7cc9cf7684a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"防抖与节流是两个出于性能考虑提出的概念，如果在短时间内多次触发同一函数，可能会产生页面的卡顿，以及性能的降低，针对这种情况，提出了防抖与节流两个解决方案。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"00bfeb83-6cfd-4269-8728-6a0204395e1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"防抖与节流的概念"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"47017505-8448-4076-ba68-f6cb0955501a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了解释如上的两个概念，我们以一个例子开始。有一个搜索框，当用户输入搜索内容时，会同时向后端发起请求，给出相近的词条以给用户提示"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61465f92-93ef-440b-beec-c11e74938fa6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果当每次用户输入一个字符都向都端发起一个请求，那么发起请求的次数就太频繁了，这时有两种策略："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"e13b57da-60b3-481f-84cb-b04354c86890","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"04120a93-0e99-4dd0-b7e9-3d1b7b45d5eb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e9a4b850-4639-4e64-9038-e54971046f26","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当用户停止输入一段时间后，例如 500ms，我们向后端发起一个请求"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b487bdac-f5fe-414e-9bbc-e358e708e063","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"332b837b-6aac-49f5-a0af-a6a4aa38dbe6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每隔固定的时间向后端发起一个请求"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf4aa6ae-9367-49c1-94f9-df1d4f1240e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一种策略我们叫做防抖，第二种策略我们称为节流。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3304b95b-1df1-4003-a9ba-9b4551a0d9ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一个形象的比喻，以公交车发车为例，有两种发车方案："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"608b8af4-5aca-45c9-9081-03e52c4810c0","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"57a1e9aa-509a-40e3-8769-b17bc78ef615","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b38ac8d6-0c1c-4c56-a3a1-a92b10ec4a61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当乘客上车后，如果经过一段时间没有乘客上车了，就发车"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2cfee13a-ff6d-4eac-ae41-279c39acc621","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"048bdfea-21b3-4bc3-bd05-3670d601f2b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"发车时间固定，每隔一段时间发一次车"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f33e256-1919-49da-8c19-0eca2d7098f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们将发车比喻为向后端发起一个请求，那么这两种发车的策略就分别对应为防抖和节流。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c1665eeb-905f-4930-9bbb-6276f7ebd1ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"防抖实现"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"88318e01-c294-4c7f-98e0-e6f2a4173894","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们要实现一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"debounce"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数，该函数接收一个函数以及时间，返回一个函数，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"debounce"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数的作用就是将一个普通的函数变为防抖的函数，即多次调用该函数，只有经过指定时间后，函数才会触发一次"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"f4a62dd0-305d-4885-849e-afcc4f4ed87e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2ed13a97-30f0-45c6-b513-e1734259a397","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const debounce = (fn, time) => {\n    let timerId\n\n    return function(...args) {\n        clearTimeout(timerId)\n        timerId = setTimeout(() => {\n            fn.apply(this, args)\n        }, time)\n    }\n}","collabId":"34281d93-1edd-4dca-83e5-0d3facf0197c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c7350e95-b29b-4459-af97-3d7930403c00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面有几个注意事项："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"fe6f62d5-b5bc-4647-8347-2428cb8175cc","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b8cc7519-e0c1-4393-93c9-9b37489b0ed6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66a2da37-e1bb-4690-a83e-1ce1c04352bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"timerId"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 要放在返回的函数之外，形成闭包，以确保每次调用函数时访问的是同一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"timerId"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"28b4733b-a871-4cc3-8cc0-b83744189c8d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2f59e9f6-8b6a-469e-81ab-cbd78244bc65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"返回的函数不要写成箭头函数的形式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"190e6ab2-c797-4d4f-b3dd-0041a0692494","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e27a1726-e1fb-4e00-b038-6c55fd8e2b09","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 不要写成这样\nreturn (...args) => {\n    \n}","collabId":"460c84ed-a926-4649-93fe-95068f5e90f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0e7e09d0-ad78-41ae-aba8-ead112e19d96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为这样会丢失 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7cc201e1-c1b5-4ed2-9a1f-4dc73365f480","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a161999e-6fda-41e2-b330-ec44d60b498e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后要通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"apply"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传入"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b4c1616f-8d21-4dfd-9f24-dff493b050e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"节流实现"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"864b936e-218f-43d1-8e4f-5de16fe117b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们要实现一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"throttle"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数，该函数的作用是将一个普通函数转化为节流函数，也接收两个参数，第一个参数为函数，第二个函数为时间，当多次调用该函数，在一段时间内只能触发一次"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"c61bc2bb-66c6-486d-af95-ecf044a9f397","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"00a00efc-ab67-4de7-805e-b791d82a5ba3","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const throttle = (fn, time) => {\n    let pre = 0;\n\n    return function(...args) {\n        let now = Date.now();\n        if (now - pre > time) {\n            fn.apply(this, args);\n            pre = now;\n        }\n    }\n}","collabId":"2a98ad8d-ec19-477b-9ca7-70622d5e443c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1725f3e0-2c65-4dee-a122-90c9d36fd89d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pre"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示上一次执行的时间，默认值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这样第一次调用该函数时会立即执行该函数。每次执行函数时，判断距上次执行已经经过的时间 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Date.now() - start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是否大于设定的时间，大于则执行，小于则不执行，以达到节流的目的，执行函数后，设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pre"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为当前函数执行时的时刻。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"b6f887e6-ece1-4eee-a775-114cbbc17a89","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"646ee63a-8e6c-4c4a-96d6-db6304598a58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"返回的函数不能写为箭头函数，同样是因为会丢失 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C__Users_pc_.editor_resources_janis-dzenis-2BYcUe94cIY-unsplash_4662836a-e53a-46dd-80b0-121ca99fb5fd_7cf43790-849f-4cac-b6ee-c71b261ba16f.jpg","createTime":1588204800000,"updateTime":1773215107105},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1773215107105}}